<script module>
  import Demo from "$ui/components/Demo.abide"
  import IfDemo from "$ui/demos/templating/conditionals/IfDemo.abide"
  import SwitchDemo from "$ui/demos/templating/conditionals/SwitchDemo.abide"
</script>


<main class="page">
  <h1>Conditionals</h1>
  <p class="lead">A conditional block picks exactly one branch and swaps the DOM when the state it reads crosses a threshold. Nothing is diffed by hand — the block reconciles fine-grained.</p>
  <Demo id="if" title="<code>&#123;#if&#125;</code> / <code>&#123;:else if&#125;</code> / <code>&#123;:else&#125;</code>" client="src/ui/demos/templating/conditionals/IfDemo.abide" tab="client">
    <IfDemo />
  </Demo>
  <aside class="aside">
    <p>The block picks exactly one branch and swaps the DOM when <code>level</code> crosses a threshold.</p>
  </aside>
  <Demo id="switch" title="<code>&#123;#switch&#125;</code> / <code>&#123;:case&#125;</code> / <code>&#123;:default&#125;</code>" client="src/ui/demos/templating/conditionals/SwitchDemo.abide" tab="client">
    <SwitchDemo />
  </Demo>
  <aside class="aside">
    <p>A value is matched against cases; an unmatched value falls through to <code>&#123;:default&#125;</code>.</p>
  </aside>
</main>
